Z||000000||Doni Hagan||08-31-2001||12:13 AM||||I want to get rid of the seam between the REAR clip and roof panel. I tried filling it with fiberglass and epoxy but a hairline crack has appeared that I can't get rid of. <BR>No matter what I put on it now, the crack comes back. I gonna do a fake "targa" look on the top anyway but would like to know what I did wrong. <P>Any ideas?  Thanks.<BR>I just noticed a typo. I said FRONT clip...I meant REAR clip. It probably makes more sense now.  <p>[This message has been edited by Doni Hagan (edited 08-31-2001).]||||reg||5
